# DUSKLING A7, THE AMBER NEST (room 28): a slam drops the ceiling eye, a slam on the eye leaps you up to the amber egg.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 28
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 7
hold LEFT 3
hold LEFT+A 2
wait 3
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 12
hold LEFT+A 2
wait 3
hold LEFT 17
wait 2
hold LEFT 7
hold LEFT+A 1
hold A 42
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 7
hold LEFT 3
hold LEFT+A 2
wait 3
hold A 33
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 24
wait 2
expect state == 4
expect egg_got == 1
